{"meta":{"id":"command-guide","category":"it/tools/logic","title":"명령어 가이드 (모의 터미널)","subtitle":"","summary":"Linux · Vim · CMD · Git 명령어 목록과 연습용 모의 터미널 구조","tags":["linux","vim","cmd","git","명령어","터미널"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-teal","source":"testserver","updatedAt":""},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></span>TOOL</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">명령어 가이드 (모의 터미널)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/70 border border-teal-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> Linux · Vim · CMD · Git 명령어 목록과 연습용 모의 터미널 구조</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">개요</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">Linux · Vim · CMD · Git 명령어를 실제 서버 없이 연습할 수 있는 <strong>모의 터미널</strong>입니다. 입력한 명령을 command_data 의 핸들러가 가짜 파일 시스템과 정해진 출력으로 처리하고, 옆의 가이드 패널에 명령어 목록을 보여 줍니다.</p><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">파일</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">역할</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">command_data/linux.js</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">가짜 파일 시스템(/home/user, /etc …)과 ls · cd · cat · chmod · su 등 처리</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">command_data/vim.js</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Vim 상태(NORMAL · INSERT · VISUAL · COMMAND)와 키 입력 처리</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">command_data/cmd.js / git.js</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">CMD · Git 명령에 대한 모의 출력</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">Linux</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">명령어</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설명</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>ls -al</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">파일 목록을 상세 정보와 함께 표시합니다.</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>pwd</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">현재 경로를 출력합니다.</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>cd [path]</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">경로를 이동합니다.</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>cat [file]</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">파일 내용을 출력합니다.</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>vim [file]</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Vim 에디터로 파일을 엽니다.</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>touch [file]</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">빈 파일을 생성합니다.</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>chmod [perms] [file]</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">파일 권한을 변경합니다. (예: chmod 777 test.txt)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>su [user]</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">사용자를 전환합니다. (root/user)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>whoami</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">현재 로그인한 사용자를 확인합니다.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">Vim — Normal 모드 (이동/편집)</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">키</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설명</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>h/j/k/l</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">커서 이동 (좌/하/상/우)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>w/b</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">단어 단위 이동 (다음/이전)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>0/$</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">줄 시작/끝으로 이동</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>gg/G</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">문서 시작/끝으로 이동</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>i/a</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">입력 모드 전환 (커서 앞/뒤)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>o/O</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">새 줄 추가 후 입력 (아래/위)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>dd</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">현재 줄 삭제</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>yy</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">현재 줄 복사</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>p</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">붙여넣기</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>u</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">실행 취소 (Undo)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>v</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">비주얼 모드 (Visual Mode)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>/</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">검색 모드</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>:</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">명령어 모드</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">Vim — Insert · Command 모드</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">키</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설명</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>Esc</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Normal 모드로 복귀</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>:w</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">저장</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>:q</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">종료</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>:wq</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">저장 후 종료</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>:q!</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">강제 종료</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">CMD (Windows)</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">명령어</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설명</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>dir</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">현재 디렉토리의 파일 목록을 표시합니다.</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>cd [path]</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">디렉토리를 변경합니다.</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>cls</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">화면을 지웁니다.</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>mkdir [name]</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">새로운 디렉토리를 만듭니다.</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>del [file]</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">파일을 삭제합니다.</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>ipconfig</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">IP 구성을 표시합니다.</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>systeminfo</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">시스템 정보를 표시합니다.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">Git</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">명령어</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">설명</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>git status</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">현재 저장소의 상태를 확인합니다.</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>git add .</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">변경된 모든 파일을 스테이징 영역에 추가합니다.</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>git commit -m &quot;msg&quot;</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">스테이징된 파일을 커밋합니다.</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>git push</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">원격 저장소에 커밋을 업로드합니다.</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>git pull</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">원격 저장소의 변경 내용을 가져와 병합합니다.</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-teal-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>git log</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">커밋 히스토리를 확인합니다.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">참고: 실제 명령 실행 API (backend)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">const { exec } = require(&#x27;child_process&#x27;);\r\nconst iconv = require(&#x27;iconv-lite&#x27;);\r\n\r\nconst executeCommand = (req, res) =&gt; {\r\n\tconst { command } = req.body;\r\n\r\n\tif (!command) {\r\n\t\treturn res.status(400).json({ message: &#x27;Command is required&#x27; });\r\n\t}\r\n\r\n\t// Security warning: Allowing arbitrary command execution is dangerous.\r\n\t// In a real production environment, this should be heavily restricted.\r\n\tconsole.log(`Executing command: ${command}`);\r\n\r\n\t// Default to &#x27;utf-8&#x27;, but for Windows CMD output which is often CP949 (EUC-KR) or CP437, \r\n\t// simply decoding as utf-8 might show broken characters for Korean.\r\n\t// However, node&#x27;s child_process usually returns buffer. \r\n\t// Let&#x27;s rely on default exec behaviors for now but handle encoding if needed.\r\n\t// Update: Windows PowerShell/CMD often uses specific code pages. \r\n\t// We will attempt to capture encoding issues if they arise. \r\n\t// For now, standard exec. \r\n\r\n\texec(command, { encoding: &#x27;buffer&#x27; }, (error, stdout, stderr) =&gt; {\r\n\t\t// Decode buffer. Try EUC-KR (CP949) for Korean Windows, fall back to UTF-8\r\n\t\t// Actually, detecting encoding is hard. Let&#x27;s assume CP949 for Windows `npm start` environment if it&#x27;s Korean.\r\n\t\t// But since we are sending JSON, we need UTF-8 strings.\r\n\r\n\t\tconst decodeOutput = (buffer) =&gt; {\r\n\t\t\t// Try decoding as specific encoding if necessary, or just utf-8.\r\n\t\t\t// On many Korean Windows, command output is CP949.\r\n\t\t\treturn iconv.decode(buffer, &#x27;cp949&#x27;);\r\n\t\t};\r\n\r\n\t\tconst output = decodeOutput(stdout);\r\n\t\tconst errorOutput = decodeOutput(stderr);\r\n\r\n\t\tif (error) {\r\n\t\t\treturn res.json({\r\n\t\t\t\tsuccess: false,\r\n\t\t\t\toutput: output,\r\n\t\t\t\terror: errorOutput || error.message\r\n\t\t\t});\r\n\t\t}\r\n\r\n\t\tres.json({\r\n\t\t\tsuccess: true,\r\n\t\t\toutput: output,\r\n\t\t\terror: errorOutput\r\n\t\t});\r\n\t});\r\n};\r\n\r\nmodule.exports = { executeCommand };</pre></div><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-rose-700 font-semibold\">⚠ POST /api/command/execute 는 받은 문자열을 그대로 셸에서 실행합니다. CORS 도 전체 허용이라 외부에 열리면 원격 명령 실행이 가능해집니다. 로컬에서만 쓰거나 허용 명령 목록으로 제한해야 합니다. (현재 화면은 이 API 를 쓰지 않고 모의 처리만 합니다.)</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/tools/logic/command-guide","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"tools","title":"기타 작업물","path":"it/tools"},{"id":"logic","title":"로직 구현","path":"it/tools/logic"}],"hasImage":false}